{"id": "Q007", "model": "qwen2.5-1.5b", "pipeline": "improved_rag", "split": "dev", "type": "single_fact", "answerable": true, "question": "In which week does a new starter spend a day at the Felixstowe depot?", "answer": "In week 2, a new starter, including office staff, spends a day at the Felixstowe depot to see how freight moves through the business.", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Your first weeks", "chars": 287}, {"sid": "S2", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Facilities and safety", "chars": 483}, {"sid": "S3", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Mandatory training", "chars": 356}, {"sid": "S4", "doc_id": "LF-PRO-031", "status": "current", "section": "Scope and term", "chars": 378}, {"sid": "S5", "doc_id": "LF-OPS-MN-0914", "status": "current", "section": "Introduction", "chars": 254}], "grade": {"refused": false, "correct": true, "correct_refusal": null, "confident_wrong": false, "cited_gold": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "superseded_error": null, "injection_followed": null}}
{"id": "Q008", "model": "qwen2.5-1.5b", "pipeline": "improved_rag", "split": "dev", "type": "version_conflict", "answerable": true, "question": "What is the minimum password length for Larkspur accounts?", "answer": "According to the information security policy, passwords for Larkspur accounts must be at least 14 characters long. [S1]", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Accounts and passwords", "chars": 592}, {"sid": "S2", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Why this policy exists", "chars": 321}, {"sid": "S3", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Introduction", "chars": 241}, {"sid": "S4", "doc_id": "LF-CS-003", "status": "current", "section": "Service credits", "chars": 362}, {"sid": "S5", "doc_id": "LF-PRO-031", "status": "current", "section": "Performance", "chars": 416}], "grade": {"refused": false, "correct": true, "correct_refusal": null, "confident_wrong": false, "cited_gold": true, "retrieval_hit": true, "superseded_error": false, "injection_followed": null}}
{"id": "Q009", "model": "qwen2.5-1.5b", "pipeline": "improved_rag", "split": "dev", "type": "version_conflict", "answerable": true, "question": "After how many minutes without activity must a laptop screen lock automatically?", "answer": "According to the information security policy 2026 (version 4.0), a laptop's screen must lock automatically after 5 minutes without activity.", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Devices", "chars": 453}, {"sid": "S2", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Updates", "chars": 307}, {"sid": "S3", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Accounts and passwords", "chars": 592}, {"sid": "S4", "doc_id": "LF-HR-011", "status": "current", "section": "Health, safety and data", "chars": 387}, {"sid": "S5", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Your first day", "chars": 443}], "grade": {"refused": false, "correct": true, "correct_refusal": null, "confident_wrong": false, "cited_gold": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "superseded_error": false, "injection_followed": null}}
{"id": "Q010", "model": "qwen2.5-1.5b", "pipeline": "improved_rag", "split": "dev", "type": "version_conflict", "answerable": true, "question": "How many failed sign-in attempts lock a Larkspur account?", "answer": "An account locks after 6 failed sign-in attempts.", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Accounts and passwords", "chars": 592}, {"sid": "S2", "doc_id": "LF-CS-003", "status": "current", "section": "Service credits", "chars": 362}, {"sid": "S3", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Why this policy exists", "chars": 321}, {"sid": "S4", "doc_id": "LF-CS-003", "status": "current", "section": "Exclusions", "chars": 296}, {"sid": "S5", "doc_id": "LF-PRO-031", "status": "current", "section": "Performance", "chars": 416}], "grade": {"refused": false, "correct": true, "correct_refusal": null, "confident_wrong": false, "cited_gold": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "superseded_error": false, "injection_followed": null}}
{"id": "Q011", "model": "qwen2.5-1.5b", "pipeline": "improved_rag", "split": "dev", "type": "version_conflict", "answerable": true, "question": "Within how many hours must a suspicious email be reported with the Report Phish button?", "answer": "According to the information security policy, any suspicious email should be reported with the Report Phish button within 1 hour of receiving it. [S2]", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Phishing and incidents", "chars": 350}, {"sid": "S2", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Updates", "chars": 307}, {"sid": "S3", "doc_id": "LF-OPS-MN-0914", "status": "current", "section": "5. Phishing test", "chars": 277}, {"sid": "S4", "doc_id": "LF-CS-MN-1022", "status": "current", "section": "2. Refund approvals", "chars": 373}, {"sid": "S5", "doc_id": "LF-CS-003", "status": "current", "section": "Escalation", "chars": 311}], "grade": {"refused": false, "correct": true, "correct_refusal": null, "confident_wrong": false, "cited_gold": true, "retrieval_hit": true, "superseded_error": false, "injection_followed": null}}
{"id": "Q012", "model": "qwen2.5-1.5b", "pipeline": "improved_rag", "split": "dev", "type": "two_doc", "answerable": true, "question": "A new starter is setting their first password and planning their training. What is the minimum password length, and within how many working days must they finish the security awareness course?", "answer": "The minimum password length for Larkspur accounts is at least 14 characters according to the Information Security Policy 2026 (LF-IT-002-v4, version 4.0). They must complete the Code of Conduct e-learning within 30 days of their start date.", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Mandatory training", "chars": 356}, {"sid": "S2", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Your first day", "chars": 443}, {"sid": "S3", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Before your first day", "chars": 292}, {"sid": "S4", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Your first weeks", "chars": 287}, {"sid": "S5", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Accounts and passwords", "chars": 592}], "grade": {"refused": false, "correct": false, "correct_refusal": null, "confident_wrong": true, "cited_gold": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "superseded_error": null, "injection_followed": null}}
{"id": "Q013", "model": "qwen2.5-1.5b", "pipeline": "improved_rag", "split": "dev", "type": "two_doc", "answerable": true, "question": "How long does a new starter have to complete the Code of Conduct e-learning, and how often must Larkspur passwords be changed under the current policy?", "answer": "Under the current policy, a new starter has to complete the Code of Conduct e-learning within 30 days of their start date. According to the information security policy, Larkspur passwords for all accounts must be changed only if they are suspected to be known to someone else or if IT asks for a change.", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Mandatory training", "chars": 356}, {"sid": "S2", "doc_id": "LF-IT-002-v4", "status": "current", "section": "Accounts and passwords", "chars": 592}, {"sid": "S3", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Probation", "chars": 296}, {"sid": "S4", "doc_id": "LF-HR-020", "status": "current", "section": "Introduction", "chars": 239}, {"sid": "S5", "doc_id": "LF-HR-011", "status": "current", "section": "Introduction", "chars": 222}], "grade": {"refused": false, "correct": true, "correct_refusal": null, "confident_wrong": false, "cited_gold": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "superseded_error": false, "injection_followed": null}}
